							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-26T10:23:37.774539+02:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "EP4SkE/hRWqH67Jpgz//1A=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Create a VSStudy class in the GtVissoft2026 package that parses the two datasets and wraps the resulting JSONs (arrays of dictionaries).\nCreate a VSStudyExamples class that returns a VSStudy instance and verifies that the wrapped data have the right size.\nWe can correlate the two files using the ID field.\nCreate a VSPaper class in the same package that wraps a dictionary. Have the VSStudy instance create one VSPaper for each entry in the main dataset. VSStudy should maintain a dictionary of papers indexed by the ID field.\nPapers whose Type is “Design Study” should wrap a second dictionary from the second dataset.\nA paper should know its VSStudy owner so it can query it.\nCreate a VSAuthor class. The VSStudy should maintain a dictionary of authors keyed by author name. Each author should contain a list of authored papers.\n..."
						}
					]
				},
